        "claim": "The standard IHS already rose 66% in February 2024 to \u00a31,035 per year per adult.",
        "evidence_id": "E5",
        "quote": "a substantial increase in the standard IHS rate in February 2024, which saw it rise by 66% from \u00a3624 to \u00a31,035 per year for most adults"
      },
      {
